index.description:
Persistent code index configuration (`[index]` table). When absent,
the index is enabled with the built-in `tree-sitter` symbol backend;
every capability is individually switchable. See docs/INDEX.md.

max_agents.description:
Per-run cap on sub-agents a workflow may spawn (concurrent +
total). Unset → the engine default (`DEFAULT_MAX_SUBAGENTS` = 10);
values of 0 or above `MAX_SUBAGENTS` (20) are rejected at load.

